@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
class User
class Role
class Permission
class RoleAssignment {
  tenant_id
  object_scope
  valid_until
}
class Tenant
class Facility
Tenant "1" -- "*" User
Tenant "1" -- "*" Role
User "1" -- "*" RoleAssignment
Role "1" -- "*" RoleAssignment
Role "*" -- "*" Permission
RoleAssignment "0..*" .. "0..*" Facility : object_scope
note right of RoleAssignment
Доступ определяется одновременно:
1. tenant пользователя;
2. разрешением роли;
3. объектной областью;
4. сроком назначения.
end note
@enduml
